# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Privacy-locked generated state
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Root-level runtime state written by the application or test harnesses on
# every run (task queues, learning/presence status, onboarding, opportunity
# bookmarks, activation/scope registries). These are generated state, not
# source, and are never committed. Keeping them ignored prevents an accidental
# `git add -A` from staging fresh copies or local personal data.
